# Keep the build context small and reproducible.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/publish/
**/PublishOutput/
**/installer/
**/.vs/
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/node_modules/
**/*.user
**/*.suo

# UI project is not shipped to the server image.
BrowserApp.UI/
BrowserApp.Tests/

# Browser engine assets, downloads, profiles — never needed by the server.
**/Resources/BuiltInExtensions/
**/UserData/
**/Profiles/
**/browser.db
**/browser.db-*

# Misc.
**/logo/
**/docs/
**/scripts/
**/*.log
**/*.md
.git/
.gitignore
